  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello,\nI have been doing commissions and creating models for many people on  VRC for a while now, others that do the same will  know of the problem with VRChats newest verification system.\nYou have to sign into other peoples account. Its allways been like that. But after that the buyer has to verify a email that is send to the email adress that is  linked to the VRC account of the buyer.\nThis makes it more of a pain to upload models for content creators because some of the buyers don't get that important verification email.\nSo I came up with a idea.\nI think there should be a new system implemented for anyone who want's to share a model with someone  else.\nThe way I thought of going about it, and I bet many other had the same  idea, is by creating a key based system where a creator can generate a key, by generating a key, the creator is uploading the avatar into the VRChat cloud.\nNow the creator, sends the key  to the person that is wanting the model and all they have to do is put the code in there VRC Account on VRChats website and the model will be put on there account.\nOf  course it's a one time use.\n I've seen it done on other Social VR Platforms and I would love to see it on VRChat. It will make sharing models a lot easier and safer.\nThank you for your attention.",
